Software downloaded and executed at runtime (not bundled in this APK, licensed separately):

  - OpenChamber (@openchamber/web)   - the web server and UI the app displays
  - OpenCode (@opencode/cli)         - the agent runtime used by OpenChamber
  - Alpine Linux minirootfs 3.24.1   - the guest userland
  - Node.js, npm, git, ripgrep and other Alpine packages, each under its own license

Bundled native components (compiled into the APK's native libraries, not downloaded at runtime):

  - PRoot 5.1.107.98: GPL-2.0-or-later; https://github.com/termux/proot
  - talloc 2.5.0: LGPL-3.0-or-later (with the GPL-3.0 text it refers to); https://www.samba.org/ftp/talloc/
